# .gitignore — link-hardware (repository root)
#
# Scope: environment noise only — editors, OS, local tooling.
#
# Per-artifact rules (KiCad volatiles, fab-branded outputs) live in the
# artifact's own .gitignore, so that any artifact folder stays self-contained
# and could be extracted into a standalone repository without losing them.

# ── Editors / local history ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VS Code Local History extension
.history/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Obsidian config, in case the repo is ever opened as a vault
.obsidian/
